    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p>We know, if&nbsp;having three variables then total number of terms would be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>56</mn></math><br /><br />Which gives&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math> , and sum of coefficients would be&nbsp;</p><p><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>729</mn></math> .</p>"
  }
